Recommends:
 heif-gdk-pixbuf,
 librsvg2-common,
 webp-pixbuf-loader,
 yelp,
Description: simple image viewer for GTK desktops
 Xviewer is an image viewer based on the gdk-pixbuf library. It can display
 large images while keeping memory usage constant during zooming and
 scrolling.
 .
 It provides common image-viewing features such as fullscreen and slideshow
 modes, rotation, printing, metadata display, and a plugin interface.

Package: xviewer-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 gir1.2-xviewer-3.0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libgtk-3-dev,
 xviewer (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: development files for Xviewer
 Xviewer is a GTK image viewer designed for simplicity and standards
 compliance.
 .
 This package contains the header files, pkg-config metadata, and API
 documentation needed to build Xviewer plugins.

Package: gir1.2-xviewer-3.0
Section: introspection
Architecture: any
Depends:
