 ${gir:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: GObject introspection data for Xviewer
 Xviewer is a GTK image viewer designed for simplicity and standards
 compliance.
 .
 This package contains the GObject introspection data used to generate
 dynamic-language bindings for the Xviewer API.
